 <h3><u>Ye azakhana e hussain hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>(Aye azadaron suno) X (2)<br> Aye naunihaalon suno<br> (Aye pursadaron suno) X(2)</p> 
  <p>HUSSAIN YA HUSSAIN X (3)<br> HUSSAIN YA HUSSAIN X (3)</p> 
  <p>Kuch log deen e haq ko bachane ke waaste<br> Beghar hue kuch aise ke har ghar me aa gaye</p> 
  <p>(Ghar azakhana ban gaya) x (2)</p> 
  <p>1) Ghar me ZEHRA ke jab qadam aaye<br> Shahe Yasrab Shahe Umam aye<br> Pursa lene ko agaye HAIDAR<br> Unke baccho'n ke jab alam aye<br> (Farsh majlis ka jab bichaya gaya) x (2)<br> Dil ne be sakhta kiya nauha<br> (Yeh Azakhana e HUSSAIN ) X (4)</p> 
  <p>2) Dil me shohrat hunar wafadari<br> Zeenat e ishq ki hain taiyari<br> Ahle matam hi bas yeh khwahish hain<br> Khana e haq me ho azadari<br> (Nazr e MAULA ka ehtemam bhi ho) x(2)<br> Hamiyan e KHUDA kare nauha<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain)x(4)</p> 
  <p>3) Ek alam bawafa ka sajta hain<br> Is alam par KHUDA ka saya hain<br> Hoke be dast woh sakhi ab tak<br> Sari duniya ki jholi bharta hain<br> (Aur duniya ko yeh batata hain) x(2)<br> Mujhse milna ho toh yahi ana<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain )x(4)</p> 
  <p>4) Khali aagosh wali maa behnen<br> Woh jo aulaad ko tarasti hain<br> Unko aulaad bhi ataa hogi<br> Aake mannat agar yaha maane<br> (Ek jhoola yaha hain Asghar ka )x(2)<br> Woh ataa karke yeh bata dega<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain) x(4)</p> 
  <p>5) Shab ki tanhai me suno aksar<br> Ek BIBI yaha hain nauhagar<br> Apne beta ka pursa lene ko<br> Khud Baqaiya se aayi hain maadar<br> (Rone waalon se roke kehti hain)x(2)<br> Isko aabaad hi sada rakhna<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain)x(4)</p> 
  <p>6) Qaid khane me pehli majlis ka<br> Aao ehwaal suno ahl e aza<br> Marsiya khwaan bibiyaa'n saari<br> Zakera unme SANIYE ZAHRA &nbsp;<br> (Matami qaidiyo'n ke halqe me )x(2)<br> Nauha padte the roke ZAINUL IBA&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</p> 
  <p>(Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain )x(4)</p> 
  <p>7) Hain gham e KARBALA mere dil me<br> Hain gham e berida mere dil me<br> ZAKHM E ZAINUL IBA mere dil me<br> Dard e MUSHKIL KUSHA mere dil me<br> (Qabr e Shah e Huda mere dil me)x(2)<br> Ab mere dil ko bhi kahe duniya<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain)x4</p> 
  <p>8) Baat mushkil hai yeh khuda ki qasam<br> Kya likhe Mazhar Abidi ka kalaam<br> Maa ki aagosh me suna nauha<br> Maa ki aagosh me kiya matam<br> (Aur Irfan jab alam dekhe)x2<br> Maine rote hue padha nauha<br> (Yeh azakhana e HUSSAIN hain)x(4)</p> 
